// RenkuBASIC CLI test: the bind command is gone
//
// The brief removes the ability to bind a program and the interpreter into a
// standalone executable. In RenkuBASIC the statement must fail with a clear
// message instead of silently creating a file.
//
// @requires: renkubasic
// @expect-exit: 1
// @expect-stderr-contains: bind

print "about to try bind"
bind "rk-should-not-exist"
print "bind did not fail"
